{"id":"vod_bf_151500","vodId":"151500","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"魔法少女奈叶2026","name_cn":"魔法少女奈叶2026","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260705-1/ab2ec55f1e0639f14aa5f4cd4d571cf6.webp"},"summary":"30年前，未知的“侵略性外来生物”突然出现，世界曾一度濒临毁灭。人类与这些被称为“侵略种”的生物相互争夺生存空间。虽然目前人类的安全勉强得到了保障，但世界随时可能走向终结。人们在恐惧死亡与毁灭的同时，只能对危险和灾难视而不见，麻木地过着日常生活。在这样的世界里，联合国危险生物调查机构“EXCEEDS”为了抵御“侵略种”带来的危机与灾害，开始了行动。故事的开端位于远东的岛国“瑞穗”。一位在离岛上生活、以驱除“侵略种”为业的猎人少女——久濑椎名。她唯一的愿望就是与家中唯一的亲人妹妹刹那平静地生活下去。然而，降临在椎名身上的事件究竟是——？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-09-20 09:18:42","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/24d686045802/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/68f5d8908fee/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/e3e45589d9ef/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/de51b61296fa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/7439dccd35ae/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/7ed63bdc22bd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/0875abb29271/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/b3d0080719b1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/3024b1a591b4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/39b09067aaeb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/20249507ce55/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/mofashaonvnaiye2026/e2251184fca8/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:15.139Z"}